<title>USA: P.T. Tri Polyta Indonesia sees Q4 loss.</title>
<headline>P.T. Tri Polyta Indonesia sees Q4 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>P.T. Tri Polyta Indonesia Tbk said Friday that it is expecting to post a fourth quarter loss of between $0.10 and $0.14 per ADS.</p>
<p>The company said that in the first quarter of 1997, deliveries of polypropylene in Indonesia will be curtailed for about two weeks because of factory closings and limits imposed on truck traffic during a Muslim holiday.</p>
<p>Because the Chinese New Year holiday falls in the same week, polypropylene throughout Asia will also be curtailed, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it would release results in mid- to late-February.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
